    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The community name translates to \"Palm Tree\" and this statuesque and opulent home entices you with details like arched entryways, coffered and 12' high ceilings, expansive covered terraces, and stunning Doric-style columns. You are directly across the street from your beach access and within walking distance of restaurants and shopping!<br><br>As you enter this home through the striking 8' mahogany arched entry door you immediately feel the warmth, beauty, and lavish attention to detail within this residence. It greets you with wide plank oak hardwoods opening into your front living area with a massive Flat Screen TV, multiple seating areas, and a full wet bar with a wine fridge and ice maker. There is a half bath just off the hallway before the kitchen and dining area as you move to the rear section of the first floor where dining and family gatherings offer the perfect setting. Gorgeous interior decorative columns, a stainless high-end GE profile kitchen, beautiful black granite countertops, custom tile backsplashes, and custom cabinetry are just the beginning of your journey to culinary excellence. Your dining area will seat 12 comfortably so don't be shy when inviting friends to join you. Whether cooking in the kitchen or out on the gas BBQ grill, you have everything you need to satisfy every palate.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 10)<br>• Master Bedroom #1: King Sized Bed, Custom Master Bathroom, Private Terrace W/ Gulf Views<br>• Guest Bedroom #1: Full Sized Bed, Private Bathroom, Shower-Tub Combo<br>• Master Bedroom #2: King Sized Bed, Custom Master Bath, Private Terrace, Gulf Views, Twin Pull-Out Sofa<br>• Guest Bedroom #2: King Sized Bed, Custom Tiled Bathroom, Shower-Tub Combo, Twin Pull-Out Sofa<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>• Beach Access: Only 296 Yards From Beach Access<br>• Free WiFi<br>• Gulf Views From The Many Beautiful Terraces!<br>• Gas Grill<br>• Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>• Wet Bar and Wine Fridge<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
